luna-media-player (1.0.0) noble; urgency=medium

  * First release.
  * XP-era player interface: menu bar, feature taskbar, royal-blue toolbars,
    the white library and the silver-glass transport.
  * Library that scans folders, reads tags, and sorts by artist, album and
    track number, with live search and an All Music / All Video split.
  * Playback of the common audio and video formats through libmpv, with
    shuffle, repeat off/all/one, seek, volume and mute.
  * Eight visualisations: Ambience, Alchemy, Plenty, Bars, Ocean Mist, Scope,
    Battery and Fire Storm.
  * File associations and command-line arguments, so files and folders open
    from the file manager or the shell.

